.el .ds Aq '
.TH git-harvest-id-merge 1  "merge " 
.SH NAME
git\-harvest\-id\-merge \- Fold several registered contributors into one
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgit\-harvest id merge\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIALIASES\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fold several registered contributors into one.
.PP
Folds two or more registered contributors into one, for the cases `scan` cannot resolve automatically:  the same person recorded under different e\-mail addresses, or two already curated aliases found to disagree.  The surviving alias may be a fresh name, not necessarily one of the merged entries.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIALIASES\fR>
The aliases to fold together; the last one names the survivor and may be a fresh alias
